### GET Count of Geners
GET http://localhost:4004/music-lib/Geners/$count


### GET Genre by ID expand Tracks
GET http://localhost:4004/music-lib/Geners/5ca005b6-8c87-4b9e-9f48-c52703365193?$expand=*


### GET Genre filter by title
GET http://localhost:4004/music-lib/Geners?$filter=title eq 'Blues'


### Create Geners - METHOD NOT ALLOWED
POST http://localhost:4004/music-lib/Geners/$count
content-type: application/json

{
    "title": "Dummy Gener",
    "description": "Some Desc"
}


### GET the number of Tracks
GET http://localhost:4004/music-lib/Track/$count



### GET Specific Tracks and expand its associations
GET http://localhost:4004/music-lib/Track/110e7ccd-e332-40cf-8c79-42c0bfa0b58a?$expand=*
